  "description": "Convert HTML to PDF and DOCX in C# without a browser - pure managed, no Chromium, no\n      wkhtmltopdf, no native binaries, no LibreOffice, no Office interop. Also converts Markdown to\n      DOCX and PDF; renders DOCX, XLSX and PPTX to PDF; exports DOCX to HTML/Markdown and XLSX to\n      CSV/HTML; reads legacy Word 97-2003 .doc files; reads text out of a PDF; creates/edits DOCX,\n      XLSX and PPTX; and password-protects PDF, DOCX, XLSX and PPTX. Runs on Linux, Windows, macOS\n      and arm64, and makes no network calls at runtime.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Ank.DocToolkit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-30T10:18:06.49Z",
